  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark editorial style, disciplined cyan/red/green semantics, and a clear desktop hero-to-evidence hierarchy. However, tablet composition leaves excessive dead space and produces a very long panel; mobile compresses metadata, labels, and explanatory copy to near-illegible sizes while turning the replay into a monotonous vertical stack. The mobile header also loses the brand name and visibly truncates navigation, weakening polish and orientation. Contrast proof is incomplete for 12 mobile header links and one tablet link, so an 8 is not supported.",
